# TUF .NET Conformance Test Expected Failures
# 
# This file lists test cases that are expected to fail while the .NET TUF implementation
# is being developed to achieve full conformance with the TUF specification.
# As features are implemented and bugs are fixed, tests should be removed from this list.
#
# Format: One test identifier per line, comments starting with #
#
# Test identifiers can be:
# - test_name - specific test
# - test_group - entire test group  
# - test_group[parameter] - parameterized test within a group
#
# Common test categories that might have expected failures:

# Advanced cryptographic algorithms (if not fully implemented)
# test_metadata_verification[ecdsa-sha2-nistp256]
# test_metadata_verification[ecdsa-sha2-nistp384] 
# test_metadata_verification[rsa-pss-sha256]
# test_metadata_verification[rsa-pss-sha384]
# test_metadata_verification[rsa-pss-sha512]

# Hash algorithm variations (if specific hash types aren't supported)
# test_hash_verification[sha512]
# test_hash_verification[blake2b-256]

# Advanced TUF features that might not be implemented yet
# test_delegations
# test_delegation_roles
# test_consistent_snapshot
# test_multisig_thresholds

# Network behavior edge cases
# test_max_request_length
# test_download_timeout
# test_metadata_timeout

# For now, starting with no expected failures to see actual conformance test results.
# This file will be updated based on real test execution results.